---------------------- SOLVER OPTIONS ---------------------------------------
0                      INERTIALF   Compute the inertial forces (0: no, 1: yes, 2: yes with initial ramp for accelerations passed to MoorDyn).
            100.000000 INERTIALF_RAMPT Ramp time for inertial forces to reduce coupled object instability (s). This is ignored unless inertialF = 2 (default =30)
              0.001000 DTM         time step to use in mooring integration (s)
        3000000.000000 KBOT        bottom stiffness (Pa/m)
         300000.000000 CBOT        bottom damping (Pa-s/m)
             30.000000 DTIC        time interval for analyzing convergence during IC gen (s)
             50.000000 TMAXIC      max time for ic gen (s). When using cans, it's better to start with TmaxIC. Otherwise, the cans do something weird at the beginning.
              2.000000 CDSCALEIC   factor by which to scale drag coefficients during dynamic relaxation (-)
              0.001000 THRESHIC    threshold for IC convergence (-)
              0.500000 MU_KT       Transverse line coefficient of friction (same as FrictionCoefficient).
              0.500000 MU_KA       Axial line coefficient of friction (same as FrictionCoefficient).
              1.000000 MC          Ratio between Static and Dynamic friction coefficients (same as StatDynFricScale)
            200.000000 CV          The seabed friction damping, to scale from no friction at null velocity to full friction when the velocity is large (same as FricDamp)
